{"id":"32599757d6ca82d8","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-derivation.md","title":"Derivation","display":"df-derivation — Derivation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-derivation","aliases":["57-df-derivation"],"display":"df-derivation — Derivation","depends_on":["[[57-df-proof-system]]","[[57-df-rule]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivation — Derivation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4941b4bb46ac821\" href=\"?note=e4941b4bb46ac821\" title=\"57-df-proof-system\">57-df-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdcd6260de99b7\" href=\"?note=bdfdcd6260de99b7\" title=\"57-df-rule\">57-df-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e4941b4bb46ac821\" href=\"?note=e4941b4bb46ac821\" title=\"57-df-proof-system\">57-df-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S\\)</span> 仍采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdfdcd6260de99b7\" href=\"?note=bdfdcd6260de99b7\" title=\"57-df-rule\">57-df-rule</a> 的有限元总函数约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是从零起编号的非空公式列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec j\">\\(\\vec j\\)</span> 是前提行号列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(d,\\Phi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;[d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n\\land d(n-1)=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(d(i)\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Ax}\\cup\\Phi\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\exists\\vec j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\;[R:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land R(d(j_1),\\ldots,d(j_k))=d(i)])],\\\\\n\\Phi\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists d\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(d,\\Phi,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(d,\\Phi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;[d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n\\land d(n-1)=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(d(i)\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Ax}\\cup\\Phi\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\exists\\vec j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\;[R:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land R(d(j_1),\\ldots,d(j_k))=d(i)])],\\\\\n\\Phi\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists d\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(d,\\Phi,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许任意有限元数及零元规则；空证明不产生最后一行，且不存在未定义的第零行或将一元规则当成二元规则的情况。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"e4941b4bb46ac821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-rule","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdcd6260de99b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"e4941b4bb46ac821","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}$，见 [[57-df-proof-system]]；$\\mathrm{Rule}_S$ 仍采用 [[57-df-rule]] 的有限元总函数约定。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，见 [[57-df-formula]]。$d$ 是从零起编号的非空公式列；$\\vec j$ 是前提行号列。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-rule","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdcd6260de99b7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}$，见 [[57-df-proof-system]]；$\\mathrm{Rule}_S$ 仍采用 [[57-df-rule]] 的有限元总函数约定。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，见 [[57-df-formula]]。$d$ 是从零起编号的非空公式列；$\\vec j$ 是前提行号列。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\ma